{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/7707b72acd875397bc0d6edf2c61405f.apng?t=1748873413\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/7707b72acd875397bc0d6edf2c61405f.poster.avif?t=1748873413\" class=\"bb_img\" width=513 height=126 /></picture></span><strong>Dome RPG</strong> is a role playing game inspired by video games from the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet lots of new friends and foes while you explore a strange world with unique visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of mysteries will you uncover during your trip?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/cf6f544152fcc9f6a2491e5b4f8fe87d.avif?t=1748873413\" width=512 height=252 /></span>Play as Taro, a mute boy who is new to this world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/878373893c8685c8a670d546a8f20764.avif?t=1748873413\" width=512 height=252 /></span>Meet lots of new friends during your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/c47d48b50aeeffaad39b2f3e5817c4f8.avif?t=1748873413\" width=512 height=252 /></span>Explore a weird and diverse world with many secrets to uncover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755260/extras/d015f1c4664c19862bb6c4738bdaa2ed.avif?t=174887341